* Wait advances its own thread without reserving a resource.
* Both waits run 0-3s. Look and Say then overlap at 3-4s.

Task: Visual task as visual starting_at 0 seconds
. Wait (3 seconds)
. Goal: Inspect
. . Look at Display (1 seconds)

Task: Verbal task as verbal starting_at 0 seconds
. Wait (3 seconds)
. Goal: Respond
. . Say Ready (1 seconds)
